{"sentence_id": "hb-c09-u0178-s001", "text": "I Finland kan ett barn officiellt ha en eller två föräldrar, det vill säga mammor eller pappor.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c09-foraldraskap/narration-resume-20261103T063940128096Z/hb-c09-u0178-s001.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 8.219863945578231, "peak": 0.26544189453125, "generation_seconds": 25.547194048995152, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c09-u0178-s002", "text": "Det officiella föräldraskapet baserar sig ofta på det biologiska föräldraskapet, men ibland kan den officiella föräldern vara någon annan än barnets biologiska förälder.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c09-foraldraskap/narration-resume-20261103T063940128096Z/hb-c09-u0178-s002.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 14.419591836734694, "peak": 0.315765380859375, "generation_seconds": 51.361474016914144, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c09-u0178-s003", "text": "Så kan det vara till exempel om ett barn i en regnbågsfamilj officiellt har två mammor, eller om föräldraskapet för barnet har överförts till en adoptivförälder eller adoptivföräldrar genom adoption.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c09-foraldraskap/narration-resume-20261103T063940128096Z/hb-c09-u0178-s003.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 16.99700680272109, "peak": 0.3388671875, "generation_seconds": 64.8356608801987, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c09-u0179-s001", "text": "Det officiella föräldraskapet som fastställs i lag motsvarar inte alltid den verklighet som familjen lever i.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c09-foraldraskap/narration-resume-20261103T063940128096Z/hb-c09-u0179-s001.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 9.404081632653062, "peak": 0.32183837890625, "generation_seconds": 36.5921019569505, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c09-u0179-s002", "text": "Numera anser man i Finland att föräldraskap ofta handlar mer om de känslomässiga banden mellan familjemedlemmarna och det liv de delar snarare än enbart om det biologiska eller officiella föräldraskapet.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c09-foraldraskap/narration-resume-20261103T063940128096Z/hb-c09-u0179-s002.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 16.857687074829933, "peak": 0.315277099609375, "generation_seconds": 65.74396973988041, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c09-u0179-s003", "text": "I praktiken innebär föräldraskap att man tar hand om och uppfostrar ett barn, ser till hens behov och älskar hen.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c09-foraldraskap/narration-resume-20261103T063940128096Z/hb-c09-u0179-s003.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 9.822040816326531, "peak": 0.251922607421875, "generation_seconds": 42.44338420708664, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c09-u0180-s001", "text": "Enligt finländsk lag är en person som är under 18 år ett barn.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c09-foraldraskap/narration-resume-20261103T063940128096Z/hb-c09-u0180-s001.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 5.990748299319728, "peak": 0.244049072265625, "generation_seconds": 27.93315549613908, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c09-u0180-s002", "text": "Personer under 18 år ska ha minst en vårdnadshavare.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c09-foraldraskap/narration-resume-20261103T063940128096Z/hb-c09-u0180-s002.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 5.224489795918367, "peak": 0.294403076171875, "generation_seconds": 24.727659023134038, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c09-u0180-s003", "text": "Vanligtvis är barnets föräldrar dess vårdnadshavare.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c09-foraldraskap/narration-resume-20261103T064613123526Z/hb-c09-u0180-s003.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 5.015510204081632, "peak": 0.3160400390625, "generation_seconds": 16.810522988904268, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c09-u0181-s001", "text": "Om ett barn föds inom äktenskap är båda föräldrarna tillsammans barnets vårdnadshavare.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c09-foraldraskap/narration-resume-20261103T064613123526Z/hb-c09-u0181-s001.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 7.9412244897959186, "peak": 0.29534912109375, "generation_seconds": 28.798331797821447, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c09-u0182-s001", "text": "Kvinnan som har fött barnet är barnets vårdnadshavare om föräldrarna inte är gifta och faderskap eller moderskap inte har erkänts.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c09-foraldraskap/narration-resume-20261103T064613123526Z/hb-c09-u0182-s001.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 11.075918367346938, "peak": 0.301116943359375, "generation_seconds": 46.33421755488962, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c09-u0182-s002", "text": "Detta innebär att modern ensam bestämmer om alla barnets angelägenheter även om föräldrarna skulle bo tillsammans.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c09-foraldraskap/narration-resume-20261103T064613123526Z/hb-c09-u0182-s002.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 9.891700680272109, "peak": 0.31231689453125, "generation_seconds": 40.60474006203003, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c09-u0183-s001", "text": "Om barnets mamma är gift med en man, betraktas maken automatiskt som pappa till barnet.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c09-foraldraskap/narration-resume-20261103T064613123526Z/hb-c09-u0183-s001.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 7.801904761904762, "peak": 0.356689453125, "generation_seconds": 27.54936627089046, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c09-u0183-s002", "text": "Om ett par inte är gifta, är situationen en annan.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c09-foraldraskap/narration-resume-20261103T064613123526Z/hb-c09-u0183-s002.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 4.806530612244898, "peak": 0.263702392578125, "generation_seconds": 17.90254005906172, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c09-u0183-s003", "text": "Då måste mannen erkänna faderskapet.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c09-foraldraskap/narration-resume-20261103T064613123526Z/hb-c09-u0183-s003.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 3.3436734693877552, "peak": 0.311065673828125, "generation_seconds": 11.084357330109924, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c09-u0183-s004", "text": "Det betyder att mannen officiellt meddelar att han är pappa till barnet.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c09-foraldraskap/narration-resume-20261103T064613123526Z/hb-c09-u0183-s004.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 5.921088435374149, "peak": 0.392364501953125, "generation_seconds": 20.694298611953855, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c09-u0183-s005", "text": "Faderskapet kan erkännas på rådgivningsbyrån under graviditeten eller hos en barnatillsyningsman efter att barnet fötts.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c09-foraldraskap/narration-resume-20261103T065020066609Z/hb-c09-u0183-s005.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 10.170340136054422, "peak": 0.335784912109375, "generation_seconds": 37.50007445784286, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c09-u0183-s006", "text": "Först efter att pappan erkänt faderskapet kan han bli barnets vårdnadshavare och barnet till exempel få pappans efternamn.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c09-foraldraskap/narration-resume-20261103T065020066609Z/hb-c09-u0183-s006.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 10.309659863945578, "peak": 0.390472412109375, "generation_seconds": 31.62649120716378, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c09-u0184-s001", "text": "Om en gravid kvinna har blivit gravid med hjälp av fertilitetsbehandlingar och mammans kvinnliga partner, det vill säga barnets andra mamma, har deltagit i behandlingarna, kan den andra mammans moderskap i allmänhet erkännas på rådgivningsbyrån redan innan barnet föds.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c09-foraldraskap/narration-resume-20261103T065020066609Z/hb-c09-u0184-s001.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 22.0821768707483, "peak": 0.331329345703125, "generation_seconds": 62.04744694614783, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c09-u0184-s002", "text": "Moderskapet måste erkännas separat även om mammorna skulle vara gifta med varandra.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c09-foraldraskap/narration-resume-20261103T065020066609Z/hb-c09-u0184-s002.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 7.523265306122449, "peak": 0.27191162109375, "generation_seconds": 20.420190887060016, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c09-u0421-s001", "text": "I Finland finns en moderskapslag enligt vilken ett barn kan ha två mödrar.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c09-foraldraskap/narration-resume-20261103T065020066609Z/hb-c09-u0421-s001.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 6.408707482993197, "peak": 0.2794189453125, "generation_seconds": 16.59791704895906, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c09-u0421-s002", "text": "Kvinnan som har fött barnet är alltid barnets mor.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c09-foraldraskap/narration-resume-20261103T065020066609Z/hb-c09-u0421-s002.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 4.527891156462585, "peak": 0.455474853515625, "generation_seconds": 12.67699414701201, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c09-u0421-s003", "text": "För barnet kan ytterligare en mor fastställas om:", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c09-foraldraskap/narration-resume-20261103T065020066609Z/hb-c09-u0421-s003.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 4.73687074829932, "peak": 0.331756591796875, "generation_seconds": 13.336736408993602, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c09-u0422-s001", "text": "barnet föds till följd av fertilitetsbehandling till modern och moderns kvinnliga partner eller make", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c09-foraldraskap/narration-resume-20261103T065020066609Z/hb-c09-u0422-s001.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 8.777142857142858, "peak": 0.33758544921875, "generation_seconds": 18.906101128086448, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c09-u0424-s001", "text": "båda föräldrarna har samtyckt till fertilitetsbehandlingen och", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c09-foraldraskap/narration-resume-20261103T065428283758Z/hb-c09-u0424-s001.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 5.642448979591837, "peak": 0.3017578125, "generation_seconds": 13.285466194851324, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c09-u0425-s001", "text": "ingen fader kan fastställas för barnet.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c09-foraldraskap/narration-resume-20261103T065428283758Z/hb-c09-u0425-s001.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 3.6919727891156464, "peak": 0.367828369140625, "generation_seconds": 9.180460616014898, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c09-u0426-s001", "text": "Moderskap måste erkännas och fastställas även när föräldrarna är gifta.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c09-foraldraskap/narration-resume-20261103T065428283758Z/hb-c09-u0426-s001.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 6.548027210884354, "peak": 0.384765625, "generation_seconds": 14.622383916983381, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c09-u0427-s001", "text": "Du kan erkänna moderskapet före barnets födelse på mödrarådgivningen.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c09-foraldraskap/narration-resume-20261103T065428283758Z/hb-c09-u0427-s001.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 5.990748299319728, "peak": 0.2745361328125, "generation_seconds": 14.153800174826756, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c09-u0427-s002", "text": "Myndigheten för digitalisering och befolkningsdata fastställer ditt moderskap efter barnets födelse.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c09-foraldraskap/narration-resume-20261103T065428283758Z/hb-c09-u0427-s002.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 8.568163265306122, "peak": 0.316619873046875, "generation_seconds": 19.193046041065827, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c09-u0428-s001", "text": "Du kan också erkänna moderskapet efter barnets födelse hos barnatillsyningsmannen på din ort.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c09-foraldraskap/narration-resume-20261103T065428283758Z/hb-c09-u0428-s001.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 7.801904761904762, "peak": 0.292816162109375, "generation_seconds": 15.775313542922959, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c09-u0428-s002", "text": "Barnatillsyningsmannen utreder moderskapet, varefter Myndigheten för digitalisering och befolkningsdata fastställer det.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c09-foraldraskap/narration-resume-20261103T065428283758Z/hb-c09-u0428-s002.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 10.309659863945578, "peak": 0.30401611328125, "generation_seconds": 23.245676036924124, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c09-u0429-s001", "text": "När moderskapet har fastställts", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c09-foraldraskap/narration-resume-20261103T065428283758Z/hb-c09-u0429-s001.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 3.3436734693877552, "peak": 0.396759033203125, "generation_seconds": 8.613643604097888, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c09-u0430-s001", "text": "kan barnet ges endera moderns efternamn eller mödrarnas gemensamma efternamn", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c09-foraldraskap/narration-resume-20261103T065651153633Z/hb-c09-u0430-s001.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 6.548027210884354, "peak": 0.295928955078125, "generation_seconds": 18.798089599004015, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c09-u0432-s001", "text": "båda mödrarna måste bidra till barnets underhåll", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c09-foraldraskap/narration-resume-20261103T065651153633Z/hb-c09-u0432-s001.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 4.527891156462585, "peak": 0.26080322265625, "generation_seconds": 16.04242443596013, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c09-u0433-s001", "text": "mödrarna får agera som barnets vårdnadshavare antingen tillsammans eller var för sig", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c09-foraldraskap/narration-resume-20261103T065651153633Z/hb-c09-u0433-s001.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 7.592925170068027, "peak": 0.339996337890625, "generation_seconds": 19.973653448047116, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c09-u0434-s001", "text": "barnet har arvsrätt till båda sina mödrar och deras släkt.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c09-foraldraskap/narration-resume-20261103T065651153633Z/hb-c09-u0434-s001.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 5.363809523809524, "peak": 0.3638916015625, "generation_seconds": 18.903428678866476, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c09-u0185-s001", "text": "När faderskapet har fastställts", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c09-foraldraskap/narration-resume-20261103T065651153633Z/hb-c09-u0185-s001.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 3.4133333333333336, "peak": 0.417999267578125, "generation_seconds": 12.265076043084264, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c09-u0186-s001", "text": "kan barnet ges faderns efternamn", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c09-foraldraskap/narration-resume-20261103T065651153633Z/hb-c09-u0186-s001.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 3.0650340136054424, "peak": 0.308837890625, "generation_seconds": 10.255368512822315, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c09-u0188-s001", "text": "kan fadern vara barnets vårdnadshavare antingen tillsammans med barnets mor eller ensam.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c09-foraldraskap/narration-resume-20261103T065651153633Z/hb-c09-u0188-s001.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 7.592925170068027, "peak": 0.42376708984375, "generation_seconds": 23.590764292981476, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c09-u0188-s002", "text": "Vårdnadshavaren (huoltaja) är den person som ansvarar för vården och uppfostran av barnet.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c09-foraldraskap/narration-resume-20261103T065651153633Z/hb-c09-u0188-s002.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 8.150204081632653, "peak": 0.285736083984375, "generation_seconds": 30.930979342898354, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c09-u0189-s001", "text": "är fadern förpliktad att delta i underhåll av barnet", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c09-foraldraskap/narration-resume-20261103T065952311637Z/hb-c09-u0189-s001.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 5.224489795918367, "peak": 0.260406494140625, "generation_seconds": 21.412481085862964, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c09-u0190-s001", "text": "har barnet rätt att ärva sin far och släkten på sin fars sida och tvärtom", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c09-foraldraskap/narration-resume-20261103T065952311637Z/hb-c09-u0190-s001.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 6.617687074829932, "peak": 0.32379150390625, "generation_seconds": 23.141714941943064, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c09-u0191-s001", "text": "har barnet rätt till familjepension om fadern dör.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c09-foraldraskap/narration-resume-20261103T065952311637Z/hb-c09-u0191-s001.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 4.73687074829932, "peak": 0.28729248046875, "generation_seconds": 15.774980906164274, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c09-u0192-s001", "text": "Om fadern inte erkänner sitt faderskap kan modern väcka talan för fastställande av faderskapet.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c09-foraldraskap/narration-resume-20261103T065952311637Z/hb-c09-u0192-s001.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 8.568163265306122, "peak": 0.296356201171875, "generation_seconds": 26.6587684371043, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c09-u0193-s001", "text": "Ett barns födelse registreras i befolkningsdatasystemet på sjukhuset när barnet föds.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c09-foraldraskap/narration-resume-20261103T065952311637Z/hb-c09-u0193-s001.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 7.453605442176871, "peak": 0.310333251953125, "generation_seconds": 24.388693136163056, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c09-u0193-s002", "text": "I samband med detta får barnet också ett personnummer.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c09-foraldraskap/narration-resume-20261103T065952311637Z/hb-c09-u0193-s002.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 4.806530612244898, "peak": 0.256011962890625, "generation_seconds": 17.005966343916953, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c09-u0193-s003", "text": "Detta görs om", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c09-foraldraskap/narration-resume-20261103T065952311637Z/hb-c09-u0193-s003.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 2.089795918367347, "peak": 0.40374755859375, "generation_seconds": 7.619619678007439, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c09-u0194-s001", "text": "modern har en hemkommun i Finland och", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c09-foraldraskap/narration-resume-20261103T065952311637Z/hb-c09-u0194-s001.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 3.4829931972789114, "peak": 0.24652099609375, "generation_seconds": 10.378892671084031, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c09-u0196-s001", "text": "modern har en finsk personbeteckning.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c09-foraldraskap/narration-resume-20261103T070249840759Z/hb-c09-u0196-s001.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 3.3436734693877552, "peak": 0.27215576171875, "generation_seconds": 9.765893826028332, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c09-u0197-s001", "text": "Om modern inte är registrerad i Finland kan sjukhuset inte registrera barnets födelse.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c09-foraldraskap/narration-resume-20261103T070249840759Z/hb-c09-u0197-s001.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 7.9412244897959186, "peak": 0.308929443359375, "generation_seconds": 24.223905484890565, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c09-u0197-s002", "text": "I detta fall ska du be om anvisningar vid Myndigheten för digitalisering och befolkningsdata.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c09-foraldraskap/narration-resume-20261103T070249840759Z/hb-c09-u0197-s002.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 8.359183673469389, "peak": 0.315216064453125, "generation_seconds": 25.681776912882924, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c09-u0198-s001", "text": "I Finland finns en namnlag.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c09-foraldraskap/narration-resume-20261103T070249840759Z/hb-c09-u0198-s001.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 2.716734693877551, "peak": 0.336151123046875, "generation_seconds": 9.084641141118482, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c09-u0198-s002", "text": "Enligt den ska alla som har en hemort i Finland ha ett efternamn och ett till fyra förnamn.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c09-foraldraskap/narration-resume-20261103T070249840759Z/hb-c09-u0198-s002.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 7.592925170068027, "peak": 0.30999755859375, "generation_seconds": 30.089385494822636, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c09-u0198-s003", "text": "Förnamnen ska vara förenliga med lagen.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c09-foraldraskap/narration-resume-20261103T070249840759Z/hb-c09-u0198-s003.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 3.8312925170068026, "peak": 0.280517578125, "generation_seconds": 14.872560180025175, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c09-u0198-s004", "text": "Till exempel får syskon inte ha samma namn som första namn.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c09-foraldraskap/narration-resume-20261103T070249840759Z/hb-c09-u0198-s004.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 5.433469387755102, "peak": 0.2784423828125, "generation_seconds": 17.55226021213457, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c09-u0199-s001", "text": "Barnet får sitt efternamn av sina föräldrar.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c09-foraldraskap/narration-resume-20261103T070249840759Z/hb-c09-u0199-s001.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 4.249251700680272, "peak": 0.2791748046875, "generation_seconds": 12.245655209058896, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c09-u0200-s001", "text": "Om föräldrarna har samma efternamn eller efternamnskombination får barnet detta namn som efternamn.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c09-foraldraskap/narration-resume-20261103T070543488980Z/hb-c09-u0200-s001.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 8.777142857142858, "peak": 0.299102783203125, "generation_seconds": 25.405900496058166, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c09-u0202-s001", "text": "Om ett barn endast har en förälder får barnet denna förälders efternamn.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c09-foraldraskap/narration-resume-20261103T070543488980Z/hb-c09-u0202-s001.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 6.408707482993197, "peak": 0.30706787109375, "generation_seconds": 22.14085618290119, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c09-u0203-s001", "text": "Om föräldrarna har gemensamma barn sedan tidigare, ska minderåriga syskon ha samma efternamn.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c09-foraldraskap/narration-resume-20261103T070543488980Z/hb-c09-u0203-s001.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 8.568163265306122, "peak": 0.25146484375, "generation_seconds": 24.14788980782032, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c09-u0204-s001", "text": "Om föräldrarna har separerat, bestämmer barnets vårdnadshavare vilket namn barnet får.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c09-foraldraskap/narration-resume-20261103T070543488980Z/hb-c09-u0204-s001.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 7.732244897959184, "peak": 0.296661376953125, "generation_seconds": 21.041889691958204, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c09-u0205-s001", "text": "Om föräldrarna inte kommer överens om barnets efternamn, får barnet moderns efternamn.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c09-foraldraskap/narration-resume-20261103T070543488980Z/hb-c09-u0205-s001.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 7.801904761904762, "peak": 0.29046630859375, "generation_seconds": 19.910839590011165, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c09-u0206-s001", "text": "Om föräldrarna har olika efternamn avgörs barnets efternamn enligt situationen.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c09-foraldraskap/narration-resume-20261103T070543488980Z/hb-c09-u0206-s001.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 7.314285714285714, "peak": 0.258636474609375, "generation_seconds": 24.70957829314284, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c09-u0207-s001", "text": "Om föräldrarna är gifta kan de välja endera makens efternamn eller efternamnskombination till barnet.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c09-foraldraskap/narration-resume-20261103T070543488980Z/hb-c09-u0207-s001.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 8.986122448979591, "peak": 0.271240234375, "generation_seconds": 28.625455449102446, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c09-u0209-s001", "text": "Om föräldrarna inte är gifta kan barnet få valfri förälders efternamn om faderskapet eller den icke-födande moderns moderskap har fastställts.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c09-foraldraskap/narration-resume-20261103T070543488980Z/hb-c09-u0209-s001.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 12.399455782312925, "peak": 0.34405517578125, "generation_seconds": 31.935551481088623, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c09-u0209-s002", "text": "Om föräldraskapet inte har fastställts får barnet moderns efternamn.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c09-foraldraskap/narration-resume-20261103T070933722905Z/hb-c09-u0209-s002.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 6.2693877551020405, "peak": 0.327239990234375, "generation_seconds": 16.960649008164182, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c09-u0210-s001", "text": "Föräldrarnas första gemensamma barn kan ges en kombination av föräldrarnas efternamn eller det andra namnet i ena förälderns efternamnskombination.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c09-foraldraskap/narration-resume-20261103T070933722905Z/hb-c09-u0210-s001.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 12.817414965986394, "peak": 0.452880859375, "generation_seconds": 33.589855839964, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c09-u0211-s001", "text": "När barnet föds måste man registrera dess modersmål.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c09-foraldraskap/narration-resume-20261103T070933722905Z/hb-c09-u0211-s001.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 4.876190476190477, "peak": 0.239410400390625, "generation_seconds": 12.681444721994922, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c09-u0211-s002", "text": "Ditt barn kan i befolkningsdatasystemet endast ha ett språk som modersmål.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c09-foraldraskap/narration-resume-20261103T070933722905Z/hb-c09-u0211-s002.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 6.339047619047619, "peak": 0.33392333984375, "generation_seconds": 16.813138546189293, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c09-u0211-s003", "text": "Du kan ändra språket senare om du vill.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c09-foraldraskap/narration-resume-20261103T070933722905Z/hb-c09-u0211-s003.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 3.7616326530612243, "peak": 0.28387451171875, "generation_seconds": 10.658644470851868, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
